    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis unique detached property at 86 Curragh, Castlebar, offers an exceptional opportunity for homeowners, investors and developers alike. Occupying a generous site of approximately 0.36 acres, this versatile property extends to 196.2 square metres (2,111 square feet) and is currently configured as three bedroom / three bathroom house and a two bedroom / 3 bathroom apartment with study, while also benefiting from an additional residential site with further development potential, subject to the necessary planning consents.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious three-bedroom, two-bathroom house together with a well-proportioned two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment, at the lower ground floor level, making it an ideal investment opportunity for those seeking rental income, multi-generational living or a combination of owner occupation and investment. The flexible internal layout also presents the option of easily reconfiguring the property into one substantial family residence, offering excellent adaptability to suit changing lifestyle requirements.\n\nThe house features bright and generously proportioned living accommodation, including a spacious living room, a separate kitchen, three comfortable bedrooms and two bathrooms. The second apartment also enjoys well-balanced accommodation with a welcoming living and dining room, fitted kitchen, two bedrooms, both en-suite and a bathrooms. In total, the property provides five bedrooms, four reception rooms and six bathrooms, ensuring ample space for family living or dual occupancy.\n\nWhile the property would benefit from some cosmetic modernisation, it has been well maintained and offers tremendous scope for purchasers to enhance and personalise the accommodation to their own taste. Oil-fired central heating serves the property, while large windows throughout maximise natural light and create bright, welcoming interiors.\n\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. Set back from the road with mature gardens, ample parking and a detached setting, the site offers excellent privacy while retaining superb accessibility. The additional residential site further enhances the appeal, providing exciting potential for future development or expansion, subject to the planning permission.\n\nSituated within one of Castlebar's most established and sought-after residential areas, 86 Curragh enjoys exceptional convenience. Mayo University Hospital is within easy walking distance, making the property particularly attractive to healthcare professionals. Castlebar town centre, with its excellent range of shops, schools, cafés, restaurants, sporting facilities and transport links, is also just minutes away, ensuring every amenity is close at hand.\n\nOffering flexible accommodation, an additional residential site and excellent potential for a range of uses, this property is likely to appeal to owner occupiers, investors and those seeking a home with future development opportunities."
      },
